    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can make deadly ranged and melee attacks in rapid succession.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_Combo_(Melee)\" title=\"Attack Combo (Melee)\">Attack Combo (Melee)</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_Combo_(Ranged)\" title=\"Attack Combo (Ranged)\">Attack Combo (Ranged)</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +9</p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you hit a single target with two consecutive ranged, melee, and/or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attacks during the same turn, any additional ranged, melee, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attacks you make until the end of your next turn (including <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a> and attacks made as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a>) deal +1 die of damage on a hit. This extra damage stacks with extra damage granted by other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a>.</p>",
